Package: file-library
Version: 1.0.10
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0
Maintainer: File Library <noreply@example.com>
Description: Browse and search videos, images, documents and music from several folders
 File Library indexes one or more source folders and shows the videos, images,
 documents and music inside them as a tree with file sizes in MB. The index is
 cached, so searching (case sensitive or insensitive, optionally ignoring
 delimiters) is instant and needs no rescan. The folder setup, search options
 and type filter are stored with "Save config"; changes that are not saved are
 dropped when the app is restarted. The shown list can be exported as a .txt
 file, and a right-click on any file can copy its full path or open its folder
 in the file manager. Keyboard shortcuts are listed in the About window.
